# FormSathi does not need any environment variables to run.
# This file documents the two optional paths.
#
# 1) Firebase web config lives in src/config/config.ts (not here), because Vite
#    would otherwise inline a secret-looking value into the bundle and invite
#    people to paste an API key that Firebase does not actually need for AI Logic.
#
# 2) The optional Cloud Function (see functions/src/index.ts) needs a Gemini key
#    set as a Firebase Functions secret, never as a plain env var:
#       firebase functions:secrets:set GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# Nothing else. No paid APIs, no other keys.
